<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/_house.css">
<style>
.root { gap: 28px; }
.flowstrip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
.card.code .d { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--code); }
.card.code { background: var(--elevated); }
.cardlogo { height: 24px; opacity: 0.85; margin-left: 12px; }
</style>
<style>@page { size: 900,00pt 699,75pt; margin: 0 }</style></head>
<body>
<h1>The AWS-native stack: same job, managed instead of self-hosted</h1>

<div class="col root"><div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#8b949e">INGEST + EDGE</div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">Log ingestion (CloudWatch, Firehose)</div><div class="d">streams logs into the pipeline, structured</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Network visibility (VPC Flow Logs)</div><div class="d">who talked to whom, on which port</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Edge protection (WAF + Shield)</div><div class="d">L7 rules, rate limits, DDoS mitigation</div></div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#8b949e">DETECTION (MANAGED) + CUSTOM ML</div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">GuardDuty</div><div class="d">ML threat detection</div>
<div class="d">flow logs, DNS, runtime</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Inspector</div><div class="d">vulnerability scanning</div>
<div class="d">CVEs: EC2, images, Lambda</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">CloudTrail</div><div class="d">signed API audit log</div>
<div class="d">who did what, from where</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Config</div><div class="d">configuration drift</div>
<div class="d">flags issues before they're live</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">SageMaker</div><div class="d">custom ML models</div>
<div class="d">e.g. Isolation Forest</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card blue"><div class="t">AWS Security Hub</div><div class="d">aggregates every finding, scores against CIS/PCI-DSS/GDPR</div></div></div>
<div class="row"><div class="card"><div class="t">OpenSearch Service</div><div class="d">dashboard, full-text search, Sigma rules</div></div>
<div class="card"><div class="t">Security Lake</div><div class="d">OCSF long-term storage, queried with Athena</div></div></div></div>
<div class="flowstrip"><div>Log ingestion (CloudWatch, Firehose) &#8594; GuardDuty</div>
<div>Network visibility (VPC Flow Logs) &#8594; CloudTrail</div>
<div>Edge protection (WAF + Shield) &#8594; SageMaker</div>
<div>GuardDuty &#8594; AWS Security Hub</div>
<div>Inspector &#8594; AWS Security Hub</div>
<div>CloudTrail &#8594; AWS Security Hub</div>
<div>Config &#8594; AWS Security Hub</div>
<div>SageMaker &#8594; AWS Security Hub</div>
<div>AWS Security Hub &#8594; OpenSearch Service</div>
<div>AWS Security Hub &#8594; Security Lake</div></div>

</body>
</html>
